{
  "id": "280",
  "title": "The Inedible “Gua”",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-03-25",
  "synopsis": "There are many vegetables called “gua” in Chinese, but is there any inedible “gua”?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/376/0c196d3e1edc975b1752b565e91477d533d79e58.mp3?1489606858",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "什么瓜不能吃？\n\n    西瓜、南瓜、黄瓜、冬瓜都能吃。什么瓜不能吃？\n    这是一个脑筋急转弯，请想一想！\n    你知道答案了吗？答案就是：傻瓜。",
    "traditional": "什麼瓜不能吃？\n\n    西瓜、南瓜、黃瓜、冬瓜都能吃。什麼瓜不能吃？\n    這是一個腦筋急轉彎，請想一想！\n    你知道答案了嗎？答案就是：傻瓜。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What “gua” is inedible?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "西瓜、南瓜、黄瓜、冬瓜都能吃。",
      "traditional": "西瓜、南瓜、黃瓜、冬瓜都能吃。",
      "pinyin": "xī guā nán guā huáng guā dōng guā dōu néng chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "什么瓜不能吃？",
      "traditional": "什麼瓜不能吃？",
      "pinyin": "shén me guā bù néng chī",
      "english": "Watermelon, pumpkin, cucumber and wax gourd are all edible."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But what “gua” is inedible?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "这是一个脑筋急转弯，请想一想！",
      "traditional": "這是一個腦筋急轉彎，請想一想！",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì yí ge nǎo jīn jí zhuǎn wān qǐng xiǎng yī xiǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This is a brain teaser. Try to figure it out!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "你知道答案了吗？答案就是：傻瓜。",
      "traditional": "你知道答案了嗎？答案就是：傻瓜。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zhī dào dá àn le ma dá àn jiù shì shǎ guā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you know the answer? The answer is: “idiot”."
    }
  ],
